If Gstaad, St Moritz or Cortina is the destination, I already know what I'm packing.

There are plenty of reasons to love ski season, but if I'm being completely honest, après-ski might just be my favourite part. What could possibly be better than sitting on a sun-drenched terrace, surrounded by snow-covered mountains, Aperol Spritz in hand, after a day on the slopes? Doing it in a fabulous outfit, obviously.

And while I appreciate a good day on the slopes, I'd be lying if I said I didn't give just as much thought to what I'm wearing afterwards. Think statement jackets, cosy cashmere, oversized sunglasses, fur hats, and boots made for more than just the slopes.

Consider this your guide to **après-ski extravaganza**.
